      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the 100% insurance coverage include for moves originating from Submit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The insurance covers the full declared value of every item packed by Packers And Movers In Submit, up to the policy limit approved by IRDAI. It protects against loss, theft, or damage during loading, transit, and unloading. In case of a claim, you submit the incident report, photos, and original invoice; the insurer processes reimbursement within 10‑15 business days.</p>
