      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is GST applicable on household shifting services from Submit, and at what rate?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, GST is levied on all packing and moving services. For residential relocations, the standard GST rate of 18% applies to the total service charge, including packing material, labor, and transportation. Shree Ashirwad provides a GST‑compliant invoice, which can be claimed for input‑tax credit by businesses or used for reimbursement by government agencies.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity move from Submit to a major hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, proof of residence in Submit, the e‑Way Bill generated for the cargo, and a signed service agreement. If the move is for corporate reimbursement, include the official purchase order and GST invoice. All documents must be presented at the loading point and at each checkpoint along the highway.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I verify that a mover is IBA‑approved and maintains a 4.9 rating?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Check the IBA’s official mover directory using the company’s registration number; Shree Ashirwad Packers And Movers appears as an IBA‑approved member. The 4.9 rating is aggregated from verified Google reviews, which you can view on the company’s profile page. Both credentials are displayed on the website’s trust badge section for transparent verification.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the final cost estimate for Packers And Movers In Submit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Key cost drivers include the total distance (approximately 850 km to major hubs), volume and weight of goods, type of vehicle required (18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft container), any special handling for fragile or high‑value items, and optional services such as unpacking or temporary storage. GST and insurance premiums are added on top of the base tariff.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How should I prepare my household items for the 7‑layer packaging system used by Submit movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by categorizing items: delicate glassware, electronics, furniture, and bulk goods. Remove loose accessories and wrap each piece with the high‑density bubble cushioning. Apply multi‑ply corrugated sheets for structural support, then add foam edge protectors on corners. Finish with stretch film to seal the package, ensuring the 7‑layer system provides shock absorption, moisture resistance, and secure containment during transit.</p>
